290	     * {@code membershipPoints}: level 1 for 0-1 points, level 2 for 2-3 points, level 3 for 4-5
291	     * points, and level 4 for 6 or more points. The result is then capped at the owner's
292	     * {@code membershipLevelCap} when one has been assigned, so a new household member can never
293	     * exceed one above the highest level already present in their household (see
294	     * {@link #getMembershipLevelCap()}).
